BT 1 0 0 1 0 97.8 Tm /F1 9.4 Tf 13.4 TL 4.554 Tw (Deere\222s transformation thesis is that the company is moving from a cyclical equipment business toward a) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.9466 Tw (technology-enabled \223Smart Industrial\224 model in which connected machines, precision technology and software raise) Tj T* 0 Tw .122212 Tw (customer value and make earnings more resilient. Deere\222s filings describe a technology stack and lifecycle solutions built) Tj T* 0 Tw .509962 Tw (around customers\222 production systems, and Leap Ambitions, introduced in 2022, set adoption targets for 2026. The KPI) Tj T* 0 Tw .424578 Tw (set therefore has to separate evidence that Deere is building the capability from evidence that the capability is changing) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.002214 Tw (financial outcomes. Deere does not publish a consistent annual digital-revenue series, so the dashboard combines) Tj T* 0 Tw .847357 Tw (disclosed financial metrics with the three adoption measures Deere itself reports \(connected machines, engaged acres) Tj T* 0 Tw (and highly engaged acres\), each of which is disclosed for every year from FY2021 to FY2025.) Tj T* ET
